agent-hint-no-daemon = easyshot isn't running. Start it with `systemctl --user start easyshot`.
agent-hint-access-off = Agent access is off. Turn it on in Settings › Agents, or run `easyshot agent enable`.
agent-hint-access-denied = You didn't allow this request, so nothing was done.
agent-hint-change-cancelled = You cancelled the change in the confirmation, so it was not made.
agent-hint-outside-scope = That is outside what agents may capture. Allow it in Settings › Agents, or run `easyshot agent config set`.
agent-hint-capture-busy = You're in the middle of a capture. Finish it or press Esc, and try again.
agent-hint-recording-busy = A recording is already running. Stop it, then try again.
agent-hint-tesseract-missing = Reading text needs Tesseract. Install it with `sudo pacman -S tesseract tesseract-data-eng`.
agent-hint-no-recorder = No screen recorder is installed. Install gpu-screen-recorder or wf-recorder, for example `sudo pacman -S wf-recorder`.
agent-hint-ffmpeg-missing = Exporting needs ffmpeg. Install it with `sudo pacman -S ffmpeg`.
agent-hint-no-window = No open window is called "{ $query }". Open windows: { $windows }.
agent-hint-no-window-none = No open window is called "{ $query }", and no windows are open.
agent-hint-window-ambiguous = More than one window matches "{ $query }": { $windows }. Say which one you mean.
agent-hint-no-output = No monitor is called "{ $query }". Monitors: { $outputs }.
agent-hint-no-audio-device = The sound device "{ $device }" wasn't found. Pick another in Settings › Recording, or turn the sound off.
agent-hint-no-audio-device-default = The microphone or sound device wasn't found. Pick another in Settings › Recording, or turn the sound off.
agent-hint-area-off-monitor = The area to record isn't on any monitor. Choose an area inside one monitor.
agent-hint-file-missing = There is no file at { $path }. Check the path and try again.
agent-hint-not-an-image = { $path } isn't an image easyshot can read. Use a PNG or JPEG file.
